  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution to 2020-2022 Global Fund replenishment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Core contribution to 2020-2022 Global Fund replenishment is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,201,495,371. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Sectors not specified.</narrative>
  </description>
